WEBVTT

00:25:26.869 --> 00:25:30.556
who you would describe as super talented,

00:25:30.580 --> 00:25:33.648
who is not a so-called "natural leader,"

00:25:33.672 --> 00:25:36.236
and what could you be doing
to advance that person?

00:25:36.260 --> 00:25:39.693
And very often, the best step
is to just sit down with that person

00:25:39.717 --> 00:25:42.902
and let them know how much
you've noticed and appreciated

00:25:42.926 --> 00:25:44.479
what they've been contributing,

00:25:44.503 --> 00:25:49.114
and find out from them
what their wildest dream career looks like

00:25:49.138 --> 00:25:51.204
one or three or five years from now.

00:25:51.228 --> 00:25:55.032
People assume that the quiet person
is going to be less ambitious,

00:25:55.056 --> 00:25:56.923
and so you might be shocked to find out

00:25:56.947 --> 00:26:00.006
that if you really encourage
the dreamy version of their career,